# stops at x 2448, the bench's right edge), but his hitbox is 20 px tall and
# the bench only 16, so his head (top y 220) pokes 4 px above the bench top
# (y 224). If Resi's hitbox reaches even a fraction of a pixel past the
# bench's right edge (here x 2436.2 + 12 = 2448.2), his head overlaps her
# feet; she is not falling (vy 0), so the stomp rule does not apply and it is
