# Expected: no hurt while she stands on the bench (the tourist turns at it).
# Actual: Died at 1971 (Hurt on contact with the tourist's head).
# The same shape exists at Selfie-Tourist #2's pen on the Alm (1-high hump
# at 98, tourist 20 px tall).
